    "title": "Layne's Chicken Fingers expected to add Lindale restaurant, filing shows - NewsBreak",
    "text": "15 hours ago A popular chicken finger restaurant has plans to make its way to Lindale next year. According to a filing with the Texas Department of Licensing and Regulation, Layne's Chicken Fingers has plans to add a location in Lindale on 3207 South Main Street. This is near Christus Trinity Clinic and across the street from the Walmart. Read full article",
